body:
I think it makes sense to count and/or snapshots API calls if we consider these requests as a side effect from the widgets.

This could simply be asserted during a test with something like:

```js
// ...

search.start();

await wait();

expect(searchClient.search).toHaveBeenCalledTimes(1);
expect(searchClient.search.mock.calls[0]).toMatchSnapshot();

queryByText(container, 'Home').click();

await wait();

expect(searchClient.search).toHaveBeenCalledTimes(2);
expect(searchClient.search.mock.calls[1]).toMatchSnapshot();

